demanding security from any press used for the purpose of printing or publishing, and forfeiting the copies of, any
newspaper, news-sheet, book or other document containing any of the matters referred to in sub-clause (a);
(c)
forfeiture of such security and the circumstances in which and the authority by whom such forfeiture may be ordered;
(d)
closing down any press or any premises used for the purpose or printing or publishing any newspaper, news-sheet,
book or other document containing any of the matters referred to in sub-clause (a) in spite of the forfeiture of such
